+| R03 | VERIFIED | GenMedia reports RapidOCR và PP-OCRv6 model files. | [GenMediaStudio_RE/02_SUBTITLE/SUBTITLE_EXTRACTION.md](https://drive.google.com/file/d/1RpO_YmqC3BYuyoHco5dr3ZshFKRxVcQ_/view?usp=drivesdk) · L6 · OCR Engine | File inventory+engine strings, không chứng minh upstream availability. | A08/U01: resolve public models. |
